@startuml
hide footbox
title Shared ideas — immutable submission, enhancement and review
actor Teacher
actor Admin
participant "Ideas section services" as API
database "MySQL: projection + snapshot\nattempts + choices" as DB
participant "Lease worker" as Worker
participant "Configured OpenAI / Gemini" as AI
participant "Media service / S3" as S3
Teacher -> API : POST title, description, typed uploads / YouTube
API -> API : Validate MIME, extension, size, URL and ownership
API -> S3 : Upload originals with rollback tracking
API -> DB : Transaction: idea + media + immutable snapshot
API --> Teacher : 201 persisted (immediate success)
opt Automatic enhancement enabled
 API -> DB : Detached enqueue PENDING (no wait for teacher)
end
Admin -> API : POST /:id/ai-enhancement (independent of flag)
API -> DB : Lock idea, reject active / attempt limit, enqueue original
API --> Admin : 202
Worker -> DB : Atomic claim with UUID lease; renew while processing
Worker -> AI : Original text / documents / images only
AI --> Worker : Structured result
Worker -> Worker : Deterministic essence and structure/image guards
Worker -> AI : Independent essence judge
Worker -> S3 : Stage approved PDF + DOCX / images
Worker -> DB : Lock idea; verify unexpired owner; save attempt
note over Worker,DB
 Failed retry preserves previous current result.
 Videos are skipped; people get no generative edits.
 Invalidated lease discards late output and staged uploads.
end note
Admin -> API : GET /:id
API --> Admin : Original + active + current + history + published choices
Admin -> API : Attach with version decisions
alt Active attempt and explicit publish-original confirmation
 API -> DB : Cancel lease; select complete original
else Current approved result
 API -> DB : Validate enhancementId and per-item choices
end
API -> DB : Save separate publication projection + choices atomically
API -> S3 : Post-commit cleanup of unreferenced temporary assets
note over DB,S3
 Original sources and historical improvements remain referenced.
 Only deletion of the idea/page removes their complete history.
end note
Admin -> API : Reject idea / delete page or section
API -> DB : Transaction: lock, history, sources, artifacts, projection
API -> S3 : Post-commit delete only unreferenced owned objects
@enduml
